- We adopt QueL .cite {quel} to write
	type-checked SQL
	- avoid late runtime errors
	  nice to have
  - The paper presents the type system
	  for QueL
  - The code implements the type system
		from the paper
- Equivalent to ORM (Object-Relational
	Mapping) in the OOP world

