##! query expression

```fsharp "F# first-class query expression"
let q =
	query {
		for student in db.Student do
		where student.Age.IsSome
		select student.Age.Value
		contains 11
	}
```

```fsharp "Perform query as a stream operation (Seq)"
q |> Seq.iter (fun customer ->
	printfn "company: %s contact: %s"
		customer.CompanyName customer.ContactName
)
```
